# SMOKE / REGRESSION -- rebuild the shipped submission_mol1_tmpl_mmgbsa through the refactored
# select stage, into a scratch SUB_DIR. Pass = the provenance matches the shipped one pose for pose
# (same 20 pose_ids and member sha256) and the portal diff vs the shipped zip moves 0 members.
